      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW TREACLE (2) was a last-start winner from the inside at Bendigo over 425m (23.80) after charging straight to the lead, scoring by 2.25 lengths. Expected to go close again. DR. LEVIATE (3) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.7 lengths (24.32) behind Drax Bale at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to her credit. Expecting another good run. DR. XANTHIC (1) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing second (24.44) at Traralgon in a Grade 5 over 425m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Will give a great sight again. DR. TESSA (8) placed last time and is worth some thought.",
